{"type":"message","id":"004b4473","parentId":"3de2a945","timestamp":"2026-03-18T23:33:02.442Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，用户已经将视频下载到本地了，现在我需要使用语音识别工具将音频转为文字。让我先检查一下有哪些可用的语音识别技能。\n\n从之前的技能列表中，我看到有几个语音相关的技能：\n1. `openai-whisper-api` - 使用OpenAI Audio Transcriptions API (Whisper)\n2. `elevenlabs-stt` - 使用ElevenLabs Speech-to-Text (Scribe v2)\n3. `free-groq-voice` - 使用Groq的免费Whisper API\n4. `voice-transcribe` - 使用OpenAI的gpt-4o-mini-transcribe模型\n\n让我先读取这些技能的说明，看看哪个最适合。对于长视频（36分钟），我需要考虑：\n1. 文件大小限制\n2. 成本\n3. 转录质量\n\n让我先检查一下视频文件，然后选择合适的工具。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，主人！我现在来帮您将视频转为文字。让我先查看一下视频文件，然后使用合适的语音识别工具。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:59","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"dir \"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-王秀萍*\" /s 2>nul || dir \"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\\" /b | findstr \"看看我们的地球\"","workdir":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:60","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\free-groq-voice\\SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773876763827}}
