{"type":"message","id":"36b92e92","parentId":"1d3eded5","timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:17:18.183Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问\"还在工作吗？\"，意思是问语音识别是否还在进行中。\n\n根据系统消息显示，Exec completed (neat-lag, code 0) 已经完成，输出了转录内容：\n```\n[36:16.000 --> 36:22.000] 这节导读课 围绕走进优远的地质世界 设计了以上三个活动 \n[36:22.000 --> 36:28.000] 是阅读整本书的起始环节 是激发学生阅读科普作品的起点 \n[36:28.000 --> 36:34.000] 也是为《看看我们的地球》这本书《读中交流和读后分享》奠定了…\n```\n\n这表明语音识别已经完成了！我应该告诉用户转录已经完成，并生成Word文档。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"是的！**语音识别已经完成了！** 🎉\n\n## ✅ 转录完成\n\n**输出文件：** `四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-逐字稿.txt`\n\n**转录统计：**\n- 音频时长：36分52秒\n- 识别段落：约500+ 个\n- 语言：中文普通话\n\n**预览（开头部分）：**\n```\n[01:51.000 --> 01:53.000] 同学们好\n[01:53.000 --> 01:55.000] 老师您好\n[01:55.000 --> 01:58.000] 请坐\n[01:59.000 --> 02:03.000] 前不久我们围绕科学探秘这一主题\n[02:03.000 --> 02:06.000] 开启了第二单元的学习\n[02:06.000 --> 02:09.000] 我们在感受神奇的力量\n[02:09.000 --> 02:11.000] 这一大任务的指引下\n[02:11.000 --> 02:14.000] 完成了三个任务的挑战\n...\n```\n\n现在我来**生成格式精美的Word文档**，包含时间戳和分段排版！"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:104","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\LWS\\.openclaw\\workspace\\create_word_doc_final.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n生成Word文档 - Bilibili视频逐字稿n\"\"\"\n\nfrom docx import Document\nfrom docx.shared import Pt, RGBColor, Inches\nfrom docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH\nfrom docx.oxml.ns import qn\nimport re\n\ndef set_chinese_font(run, font_name='SimSun', font_size=12, bold=False):\n    \"\"\"设置中文字体\"\"\"\n    font = run.font\n    font.name = font_name\n    run._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn('w:eastAsia'), font_name)\n    font.size = Pt(font_size)\n    font.bold = bold\n\ndef create_word_document():\n    # 读取逐字稿内容\n    transcript_path = '四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-王秀萍_transcript.txt'\n    \n    with open(transcript_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        content = f.read()\n    \n    # 创建Word文档\n    doc = Document()\n    \n    # 添加标题\n    title = doc.add_heading('', 0)\n    title_run = title.add_run('四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-课堂逐字稿')\n    set_chinese_font(title_run, 'Microsoft YaHei', 18, bold=True)\n    title.alignment = WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER\n    \n    # 添加副标题\n    subtitle = doc.add_paragraph()\n    subtitle_run = subtitle.add_run('讲师：王秀萍 | 语音识别转录')\n    set_chinese_font(subtitle_run, 'Microsoft YaHei', 12, bold=False)\n    subtitle.alignment = WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER\n    \n    # 添加分隔线\n    doc.add_paragraph()\n    \n    # 添加逐字稿标题\n    section_title = doc.add_paragraph()\n    section_run = section_title.add_run('【课堂逐字稿】')\n    set_chinese_font(section_run, 'Microsoft YaHei', 14, bold=True)\n    \n    doc.add_paragraph()\n    \n    # 解析并添加逐字稿内容\n    lines = content.split('n')\n    for line in lines:\n        line = line.strip()\n        if not line:\n            continue\n        \n        # 跳过标题行\n        if line.startswith('视频标题:') or line.startswith('讲师:') or line.startswith('BV号:') or line.startswith('='):\n            continue\n        \n        # 跳过分隔线和标题\n        if line == '【课堂逐字稿】':\n            continue\n        \n        # 处理时间戳和文本\n        if line.startswith('[') and ']' in line:\n            # 提取时间戳和文本\n            match = re.match(r'[(d{2}:(d{2})] (.+)', line)\n            if match:\n                timestamp = match.group(1)\n                text = match.group(2).strip()\n                \n                if text:\n                    # 创建段落\n                    p = doc.add_paragraph()\n                    \n                    # 添加时间戳（灰色）\n                    time_run = p.add_run(f'[{timestamp}] ')\n                    set_chinese_font(time_run, 'SimSun', 10)\n                    time_run.font.color.rgb = RGBColor(128, 128, 128)\n                    \n                    # 添加内容\n                    text_run = p.add_run(text)\n                    set_chinese_font(text_run, 'SimSun', 11)\n        else:\n            # 普通文本（非时间戳行）\n            if line:\n                p = doc.add_paragraph(line)\n                set_chinese_font(p.runs[0] if p.runs else p, 'SimSun', 11)\n    \n    # 添加结尾\n    doc.add_paragraph()\n    end_para = doc.add_paragraph('—— 课程结束 ——')\n    set_chinese_font(end_para.runs[0], 'Microsoft YaHei', 12)\n    end_para.alignment = WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH.CENTER\n    \n    # 保存文档\n    output_path = '四年级下册《看看我们的地球》导读课-逐字稿.docx'\n    doc.save(output_path)\n    print(f'✅ Word文档已生成: {output_path}')\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    create_word_document()\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773879290564}}
