{"type":"message","id":"bd3a8492","parentId":"9e4cbb89","timestamp":"2026-03-19T14:42:10.694Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我已经启动了创建 Skill 的子任务。现在让我为您总结完整的流程，并等待 Skill 创建完成。\n\n---\n\n## 📋 本次视频转录流程总结\n\n### 完整执行步骤\n\n| 步骤 | 操作 | 工具/技能 | 时间 |\n|------|------|------------|------|\n| **1** | 查找本地视频文件 | 文件系统搜索 | 即时 |\n| **2** | 安装 Whisper + Python 环境 | `pip install openai-whisper` | ~3分钟 |\n| **3** | 执行语音识别转录 | **Whisper** (本地模型) | ~23分钟 |\n| **4** | 生成时间戳文本 | Python 脚本处理 | 即时 |\n| **5** | 人工整理编辑 | 用户干预 | ~5分钟 |\n| **6** | 上传到飞书文档 | **feishu_doc** 技能 | 即时 |\n\n**总计用时：约 30-35 分钟**（含模型下载）\n\n### 关键技术点\n\n- **Whisper**: OpenAI 开源语音识别模型，本地运行，无需 API Key，支持中文\n- **时间戳格式化**: 提取 `[MM:SS]` 格式，便于定位\n- **内容过滤**: 去除 \"中文字幕组\" 等无关标记，保留课堂对话\n\n---\n\n我正在等待 Skill 创建完成，一旦子任务返回结果，我将为您提供完整的 Skill 文件和使用说明。⏳","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"process:427","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","sessionId":"96435301-bb43-4139-88c0-4b11d737985e","timeout":60000}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"process:428","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","sessionId":"96435301-bb43-4139-88c0-4b11d737985e","timeout":60000}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"subagents:429","name":"subagents","arguments":{"action":"list"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"process:430","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"log","sessionId":"96435301-bb43-4139-88c0-4b11d737985e","offset":0,"limit":50}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"process:431","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","sessionId":"96435301-bb43-4139-88c0-4b11d737985e","timeout":120000}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"process:432","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"list"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"process:433","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"log","sessionId":"96435301-bb43-4139-88c0-4b11d737985e","offset":0,"limit":100}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"process:434","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","sessionId":"96435301-bb43-4139-88c0-4b11d737985e","timeout":180000}},{"type":"